Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 20:09:22 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 4/6] Android Auto: local music by artist, album and song;
 shortcut in Playlists

Stock BitChord lists the device's music in Auto as one flat list sorted by
title. Local music now opens on All songs plus the artists; an artist opens
on its albums, and an album on its tracks in disc order. Albums are filed
under the artist most of their tracks credit (feat. guests aside), else under
Various artists; tracks with no album go under Other songs. A Local music
tile leads Auto's Playlists grid.

